[Desktop Entry]
Name=Hearth Plasma
Comment=Hearth OS: Game Mode and the Hearth Plasma desktop (KDE Plasma 6 in Hearth's look). Saved as your desktop; falls back to Hearth Classic if Plasma can't start.
Exec=/usr/local/bin/nimbus-session --desktop=plasma
TryExec=startplasma-wayland
Type=Application
DesktopNames=Nimbus
